OL,3,GNEWSACalls for stronger protection for
OL,4,Atrees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is calling for more
OL,7,Fprotections for trees.
OL,9,FGuernsey Trees for Life has written a
OL,10,Fletter to deputies, seeking stronger
OL,11,Flegal protection for trees and the
OL,12,Fenvironment; with Colin Dodd, from the
OL,13,Fcharity, saying the island was losing
OL,14,F"a lot of trees" to development.
OL,16,FHe said: "We've had about four or five
OL,17,Fcases this year of that sort of thing
OL,18,Fhappening. If there's a 200-year-old
OL,19,Foak tree on-site, it's very easy just
OL,20,Fto put a bulldozer in there. All we're
OL,21,Fsaying is we need some sort of blanket
OL,22,Fprotection for trees."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
