OL,3,GNEWSACalls for stronger protection for
OL,4,Atrees
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said tree protection orders
OL,7,Ftended to be "reactive" not
OL,8,F"proactive", applying to trees once
OL,9,Fthey were under threat. The BBC has
OL,10,Fapproached the States of Guernsey.
